msgid "Fuel Flow and Level Sensors"
msgstr "燃油流量和液位传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fuel-sensors.rst:7
#: 1039f2b129894260b654eb4ecec826d2 2686fed73611478991961446fcc1e099
#: 8f7a85c4211048eda2abed94b45efba8 d7c689764a9e49709e5d0392492f6898
#: e61abdfdc038408ab4bc55906df91f44
msgid ""
"In firmware versions 4.0 and later, ArduPilot provides the ability to use "
"fuel flow and level sensors, in addition to battery monitors. Pulse output "
"fuel flow sensors, PWM output fuel level sensors, and analog output fuel "
"level sensors are supported. Just as an analog battery monitor provides "
"current flow measurements with the capacity status being computed by the "
"autopilot, these sensors provide fuel use or level status measurements to "
"enable the same reporting and monitoring for liquid fuel systems."
msgstr ""
"在 4.0 及更高版本固件中，ArduPilot 除了电池监测之外，还提供使用燃油流量和液位传感器的功能。支持脉冲输出燃油流量传感器、PWM "
"输出燃油液位传感器和模拟输出燃油液位传感器。就像模拟电池监测器通过测量电流来计算容量状态一样，这些传感器提供燃油使用或液位状态测量，为液体燃料系统实现相同的报告和监测功能。"

