msgid ""
"These sensors can sometimes provide erroneous data due to vibrations. This "
"will cause the autopilot to assume that a higher amount of fuel has passed "
"through the sensor than has been consumed from the tank."
msgstr "这些传感器有时会因震动而提供错误数据。这会导致飞控认为通过传感器的燃油量多于油箱实际消耗量。"

